{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "9b5305acb4e29b2d167972bd8ff11eddbd00ae7a01cd28613fca60d56201411e", "ja": "年末ってマジまんじ。うける～笑", "zh": "年末真的太顶了。笑死～哈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "febe43530982fede25b92511b5b80078c94a324ce1345ab6fd8ffaee3cec680c", "ja": "あ、青羽さん……！？　どうしたんですか。\nなんだか口調が……。", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐……！？怎么了？\n感觉您的说话方式……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "756b2298f73df18442013459cc9ebec632ff7a1694bfbbb55aae8c9991609685", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　\nえへへ、いやちょっとギャルごっこしてたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，没什么，就是刚才玩了下辣妹游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3a144892612bddc5929df70cafeb82b7ba4660246288b2657ec4ea1010989b29", "ja": "ギャルごっこ？　どうして……？", "zh": "玩辣妹游戏？为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a41a0dc1c0481f3c2dcbd670b4d8655e99829a956c08de2456f6e83f58aa7aaf", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが昔、ほんの一瞬だけギャルだったので、\nそれをふと思い出してしまって。懐かしいな～。", "zh": "因为姐姐以前曾有那么一瞬间是辣妹，我突然想起了那件事。真怀念啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0498bff2ca2d93f3cd50dc6698c4f03be8e1f1e34bdb192a7db71d44896e5657", "ja": "な、なるほど……？　まあ、そういう若さって、\n必要かもですね、アイドル事務所ですし。", "zh": "原、原来如此……？不过，这种青春活力，\n偶像事务所里或许还是需要的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "72186297704420a8d7efa3307815f571727298b9deff653109dd264af19e8a25", "ja": "えへへ♪　あ、そうだ、{$P$}さん！\n社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪啊，对了，{$P$}先生！\n社长叫您过去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a8b0a772b4228b48c9d7ffd3f7f40a6cbebd80d8b84cbdecce185d3fa3c2618d", "ja": "おっと、そうでしたか。早速行ってみます！", "zh": "哦，对了，是这样啊。我这就过去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "35dcb30aae5589a36ef05822cd32d1dd533a252a36ce6a6cbc848f29d0d80e6a", "ja": "はい！　行ってらっしゃ～い♪\nじゃ、とりまあーしは事務に戻るか～。", "zh": "好的！一路顺风～♪\n那我先回办公室吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "27d90de173d5ae69c844e9f5d16c339068bc8e4019debb8305c0ef720a9a791b", "ja": "社長、音無さん！　お疲れ様です！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐！辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "eec3f443d99b82182194059fe26c91e2328b58db975476bfbb02d34a2a1c73ef", "ja": "おお、君！　よく来てくれたね。外は寒かっただろう。", "zh": "哦，是你啊！你能来真是太好了。外面很冷吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "fe6db60b0c5984ee73669b9785522d61c5504b80fc27e059a2728d4423c1707e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です！\nささ、熱いお茶どうぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n快请进，快请喝杯热茶吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "48ab8172383e1cd43267c91a20c74b7d85ae79c33542a1f1e8999640c5abed78", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　ああ、なんか年末って\n感じだなぁ……。", "zh": "谢谢！啊，总觉得有种年末的感觉啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "db3b31192534a05e840f92304996f380dd24c2e324b6e282352e8e813ec2ebd2", "ja": "うむ、まさに年末だ。そこで君には、\n一年を締めくくる、総決算の仕事に掛かって欲しい！", "zh": "嗯，确实到年底了。因此我希望你，\n能去着手负责为这一年收尾的年终总结工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a9f63e1a68c8bae21f5c95b0cc924427c7b307bbe1da2cac3ac7da13710d6c88", "ja": "総決算！　それは気合いが入りますね。\nどんな仕事なんですか？", "zh": "总决算！听起来就很有干劲。是什么工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f26a50b790eb6cbd40b667e3c559c7e2513547ef0b53201ef4032eefb375618d", "ja": "それなんだがね、フフ……", "zh": "说到这个嘛，呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "b83b6ff2dbb9b403a5d2df92e7d3fba5053edcf94fd4e9216ec735b5977c59f0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちょっと驚いちゃう\nかもしれないですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生可能会\n有点吓一跳呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "7268c99ec4d3a7ed1d9075f0568472bc5c9759c314a4f1135ccb0d1e1ce21439", "ja": "そうだな、一年の締めくくりが『アレ』とは、\nさすがの彼でも予想できまい……ふっふっふ。", "zh": "是啊，没想到一年的收尾会是『那个』，就连他也不可能预料到吧……呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "38cb93ec163447564ad4696ab5985bcf6bf26332ed08bf5080426e337d4955a5", "ja": "『アレ』って……ごくり。\nな、なんなんですか、それは！", "zh": "“那个”到底……（咽口水）。\n那、那是什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "a839712f7795856383ab66460c0aac076ed987accb08e81ca276ce88c527e371", "ja": "『アレ』とは……フフフ。", "zh": "“那个”是指……呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "2b9f0ab218a81fb5efcfc2ce97b65b0d234f2afc793605ff3380309b9877618f", "ja": "『アレ』とは……うふふ。", "zh": "所谓的“那个”就是……呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "53f2d6971ad688068987b94ba5acdf6d729a105a72d97c896d791e7742a96ace", "ja": "ちょっと、ふたりともヒキがしつこすぎますよ！\nもったいぶらずに教えてくださいよっ！", "zh": "等等，你们两个吊胃口也太过分了吧！\n别卖关子了，快告诉我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "b30a22d4d33d4a38e6aaabcc3dadd4c3faa02bedd7a859bd4455f137070dd7f3", "ja": "すまんすまん、つい君の反応がいいものだから。\n今回のテーマは、『ギャル』なんだよ！", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，只是因为你的反应实在太有意思了。\n这次的主题是“辣妹”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9bda2de9b62e27c258dbb05a18bb473d2d33b3b745d53ebdf7946ef1e4bd742a", "ja": "ギャル……！？", "zh": "辣妹……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "482461708cfaf2e1b4c00f555ba5305c3e79e7835d00231c74920d437382e493", "ja": "うむ！　ギャルと過ごす年末、というコンセプトで、\n年末のスペシャル番組を撮るそうだ。", "zh": "嗯！好像是要以“和辣妹一起度过年末”为主题，\n拍摄一部年末特别节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "a95780a4774cc5c7aa3258e6c859e2c2a796e9c665e9a50f42a32008c47f402c", "ja": "なにしろ年末特番だからね、大きな企画だよ。\nうちのアイドル達、全員に出てもらいたいとのことだ！", "zh": "毕竟是年末特别节目嘛，是个大型企划。\n对方希望我们这边的偶像们全员参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "d75fdf53c975400758234ccbe32e13a334603514d94bab5abb6a854f45d16c8a", "ja": "おおっ！　それはすごい……。\nでも、どうしてギャルなんでしょうか？", "zh": "哦哦！那可真厉害……\n不过，为什么会是辣妹呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "dab4f4aab5698fdb3c0206ea672ed3cb14c037b5e3c0931a9021fd7038f60ed9", "ja": "ギャルに理由なんてあるかね。\nギャルはギャルだ！", "zh": "辣妹哪需要什么理由。\n辣妹就是辣妹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "84e46e22598c4df4a05ba8bbc6762e50bdfa5b0453e82dd40b1bcc3b0f124417", "ja": "え、ええと……よくわかりませんけど、\nフィーリングでどうにかします！", "zh": "呃，呃……虽然不太明白，\n但我会凭感觉想办法的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "d4ea56ea016c1ca12632e34657263b4d2efcb95c02562fee2b8a5bdb176c4bf5", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！　今回も君のプロデュース手腕を\n発揮してくれたまえ！　よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "好，很有干劲！这次也期待你大展\n制作身手！拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "c0f65ac026f4f8e0e24183124e5f42227c557aa8de5b3114b1455779cb64199d", "ja": "アイドルのみんなと頑張ってくださいね！\nファイト～！", "zh": "请和偶像们一起加油哦！\n加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "eac5613ab41f8b3da0269295610130eee7c694251d89be5e94aca35375f1fc83", "ja": "（ギャルで年末、か……いまいちどんな番組か\nイメージしづらいけど、まあ大丈夫だろう）", "zh": "（辣妹与年末吗……虽然还是有点难想象到底是什么节目，不过，应该没问题吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0312_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c06ca6e48f65c28bc184ea39927bc4762f14e14c40a188e59c3ba864d87431b4", "ja": "（うちのアイドル達なら、きっと面白い番組に\nしてくれるはずだ！　プロデュースも頑張るぞ！）", "zh": "（我们家的偶像们一定能把节目做得很有趣！我也要努力制作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
